<title>SPAIN: Cortefiel 9-mo net up 8.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Cortefiel 9-mo net up 8.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Group results at the end of September 1996 in billion pesetas. Comparison over the same month of 1995</p>
<p>    Consolidated net profit	 2.36	up  8.5 pct</p>
<p>    Sales				43.88	up 16.5 pct</p>
<p>    Cash flow			   4.31	up 15.5 pct</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
